-- title:
--   Syracuse step-19 certificate classes, chunk 2 of 10
-- statement:
--   Chunk 2 of the step-19 refinement of the twentyseven-mod-32 branch. The list collects residue classes modulo $2^{31}$ ($2147483648$) on which the Syracuse map descends in 19 steps: replaying 18 exact rows $3 b_i + 1 = 2^{a_i} b_{i+1}$ with odd intermediate quotients and closing with a terminal row whose exponent is truncated to the remaining budget of $31$ produces a quotient below the starting residue. Membership in the list is the hypothesis of the matching chunk theorem.
-- source:
--   https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collatz_conjecture; the accelerated (Syracuse) map T(n) = (3n+1)/2^v2(3n+1) of the Collatz descent programme on the Collatz Conjecture mission; row certificate architecture of CollatzFrontier.syracuse_terminal_budget_of_descent

